#: lib.rs:40
msgid "Open Terminal Here"
msgstr "Ouvrir un terminal ici"

#: lib.rs:41
msgid "Open a new terminal in this folder"
msgstr "Ouvrir un nouveau terminal dans ce dossier"

#: lib.rs:49
